<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN OPEN SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN OPEN SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading completed second</p>
<p>round scores in the 3.4 million rand ($745,000) South African</p>
<p>Open golf tournament at the par 72 Glendower course on Friday</p>
<p>(South African unless stated):</p>
<p>135 Wayne Bradley 65 70, Thomas Bjorn (Denmark) 66 69</p>
<p>138 Nick Price (Zimbabwe) 72 66, Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>69 69</p>
<p>139 Retief Goosen 72 67</p>
<p>140 Kevin Stone 70 70, Clinton Whitelaw 74 66</p>
<p>141 Nico van Rensburg 69 72, Ian Woosnam (Wales) 66 75,</p>
<p>Sven Struver (Germany) 70 71</p>
<p>142 Anders Forsbrand (Sweden) 70 72, Carl Suneson</p>
<p>(Spain) 73 69, Hennie Otto 74 68, Trevor Dodds</p>
<p>(Namibia) 70 70, Andre Bossert (Switzerland) 73 69,</p>
<p>David Frost 70 72, Paul Broadhurst (Britian) 71 71,</p>
<p>Miguel Angel Martin (Spain) 72 70</p>
<p>Note: Play was suspended because of lightning with less</p>
<p>than half the field able to complete the round.</p>
</text>
